@startuml
!theme plain
actor Planner
participant "Compliance panel" as UI
participant "LezComplianceController" as API
participant "ComplianceReadService" as SVC
participant "RouteComplianceService" as RCS
participant "RestrictionCompiler" as RC
database "MySQL" as DB

title D07 S-2 Read and recheck solution compliance

Planner -> UI: open the Route tab
UI -> API: GET /api/v1/solutions/{id}/compliance
API -> SVC: compliance(id, branchId)
alt no branch context
  SVC --> API: 403
else foreign or unknown solution
  SVC --> API: 404
else own solution
  SVC -> RCS: currentFor(solution)
  RCS -> RC: compile(branch, service date, vehicles, orders)
  RC -> DB: zones, rules, permits
  SVC --> API: per route: stored status, or STALE when the\nstored hash differs from the current hash;\nzones; LEZ-caused unassigned orders
end
API --> UI: status chips, violations

Planner -> UI: Recheck now
UI -> API: POST /api/v1/solutions/{id}/compliance/recheck
API -> SVC: recheck(id, branchId)
SVC -> RCS: currentFor(solution)
loop each route
  SVC -> RCS: check(route, current)
  SVC -> RCS: certify(route, violations, current)
  RCS -> DB: UPDATE routes SET lez_status, lez_checked_at,\nlez_ruleset_hash, lez_violations
end
SVC --> API: fresh view (no route is STALE)
API --> UI: refresh panel
@enduml
